3	The Company executed the lease agreement with Airports Authority of India (AAI) for renewal of the leasehold rights of the land for another 30 years from the year 2023.  Interest Expense on lease laibility has been provided as per Ind AS 116 and the finance cost for the nine months ended December 31 2025 amounting to INR 353.42 lakhs includes interest expense on lease liability of INR 328.09 lakhs which is notional. &lt;BR&gt; 
